# Plan Completion Gate

When the user asks to **implement a plan** (attached plan file, `docs/plans/`, or Cursor Plan todos), the agent must treat **post-implementation self-review** as a deliverable—not optional prose after tests pass.

## Before marking the task or todos complete

In the **same final turn** that reports implementation done, include these three headings (per **`implementation-review-workflow.mdc`**):

1. **Why it works** — one short paragraph tying the diff to the plan and upstream contracts (API, ingest, config, cache, tests).
2. **Edge cases** — at least **three** realistic failure modes still possible (concurrency, stale state, partial ingest, auth, missing fixtures, operator misconfig).
3. **Convention check** — naming, imports, test placement, docs/`test_runs/` logging, and every **triggered** workspace rule (cite rule names when non-obvious).

If self-review finds a gap, **fix it before** marking todos complete or telling the user the task is done.

## Plan todos (mandatory last item)

Every implementation plan YAML must include a final todo:

```yaml
- id: post-implementation-review
  content: "Structured self-review in chat (why it works, edge cases, convention check); fix gaps before close"
  status: pending
```

Do not mark this todo **completed** until the three sections above are written in chat (or the task is a narrow exception below).

## Runtime logic changes

When behavior changes, also run **`logic-change-checklist.mdc`** mentally and confirm in **Convention check**: invariants, failure modes, regression tests, and compose/host test tier match the change.

## Test and artifact bar

- Executed tests reported with pass/fail; blockers documented per **`test-first-discipline.mdc`**.
- Run artifacts under **`test_runs/`**, not **`docs/`**, per **`test-runs-output-directory.mdc`**.

## Narrow exceptions

- Answer-only questions with no code.
- Trivial typo/comment-only edits with no behavioral contract.

## Overlap

- **`plan-creation-contract.mdc`** — plan authoring structure and **`PLAN_TEMPLATE.md`**.
- **`implementation-review-workflow.mdc`** — pre-code plan + post-code review content.
- **`every-error-regression-test.mdc`** — fixes require a regression test before close.
